{"product_id":"am-i-the-princess-or-the-frog-by-jim-benton","title":"Am I the Princess or the Frog?. by Jim Benton","description":"\u003cp\u003eMore of the (nearly) true and absolutely hilarious confessions of Jamie Kelly ...Jamie's best friend is planning to display a picture of Jamie next to her disgustingly stinky beagle, as part of a project to show how pets look like their people. Gee, thanks. And her mum, in a twisted plot created by the school dinner ladies, has been asked to cook meatloaf for the whole school. Mum's cooking - known for its ability to poison anyone who touches it. Mum's meatloaf - the food that even Stinker turns his nose up at. Can Jamie survive the shame?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jim Benton\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780141335834\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 176\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45790868504729,"sku":"17RA-29780141335834","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ee124b454f6_Am_I_the_Princess_or_the_Frog_._by_Jim_Benton_Jim_Benton.jpg?v=1760460694","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/am-i-the-princess-or-the-frog-by-jim-benton","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}